{STRATEGY_GEN_NightMomentum}
{v2.5: v2.4 base + Trail A/B engine (fix dead Trail + add TRUE ratcheting trail)}
{Category A: Night Session Breakout + Overnight Gap Capture + MFE protection}
{Direction: Long Only}
{Timeframe: 15-min on TXF1}

{ v2.5 CHANGELOG (2026-06-13):

  USER REQUEST: "立即處理優化 A 修活 Trail + B 真移動停損"

  ROOT CAUSE OF v2.4 DEAD TRAIL:
    v2.4 (and v2.1 original) had a Trail mechanism with:
      TrailActATR(2.75) = activation at 2.75 ATR profit
      TargetATRMult(2.0) = TP Limit at 2.0 ATR profit

    Since 2.75 > 2.0, TP Limit ALWAYS fires before Trail can
    activate. Result: LX_NM_Trail label exists in code but
    fired 0 times in 6.5 years / 783 trades. Pure dead code.

    Principal protection was effectively ONLY initial SL
    (Entry - 2.75 × ATR). MFE peaks would round-trip with
    no protection.

  v2.5 TWO-PRONGED FIX (A/B input-switched engine):

  ★ Variant A — "Fixed Lock" (resurrect old Trail mechanism):
    - Activation: MaxContractProfit >= TrailActATR × ATR
    - Stop: EntryPrice + (TrailActATR - TrailOffATR) × ATR
    - Same calc as v2.4 but with TrailActATR lowered to 1.5
      (below TP 2.0) so it CAN activate
    - One-shot lock (stop doesn't move once set)
    - Label: LX_NM_Trail_A

  ★ Variant B — "True Ratcheting Trail" (NEW mechanism):
    - Track v_HighestClose during position
    - Activation: MaxContractProfit >= TrailActATR × ATR
    - Stop: v_HighestClose - TrailOffATR × ATR
    - DYNAMICALLY moves up as new highs are made
    - Captures MFE peaks (e.g. 200pt peaks that would otherwise
      round-trip to 0)
    - Label: LX_NM_Trail_B
    - Matches L5 v19.7 God Mode trail concept (proven effective)

  PARAMETER CHANGES:
    TrailActATR : 2.75 -> 1.5  (now BELOW TargetATRMult=2.0)
    TrailOffATR : 0.7  -> 0.7  (unchanged)
    Trail_Mode  : NEW input (0=off, 1=Variant A, 2=Variant B)

  DEFAULT: Trail_Mode = 2 (Variant B = true ratcheting)
    User can toggle to 1 (A) or 0 (off=v2.4 baseline) for A/B test.

  NEW VARIABLES:
    v_HighestClose : tracks max close since entry (for B)
    v_TrailArmed   : flag once activation threshold first hit
    Trail_Warn_ID  : red text warning if config is dead

  DEAD-CONFIG WARNING:
    If TrailActATR >= TargetATRMult AND Trail_Mode > 0:
      → Trail will be unable to activate (TP fires first)
      → Red text on chart warns user
      → Prevents silent dead-code reincarnation

  WHAT v2.5 PRESERVES FROM v2.4:
    All other logic intact:
      ExitTime(500) - v2.1 original gap capture
      Entry condition Time < ExitTime
      LX_NM_Time at 09:00 (overnight gap capture)
      Initial SL at Entry - 2.75 × ATR (principal protection)
      TP at Entry + 2.0 × ATR
      Holiday safety module (LX_NM_Holiday at 04:15)
      Manual_Kill_Switch / Registry_Valid_Until
      v_Holiday_Block entry gate

  EXPECTED IMPACT (v2.5 Variant B vs v2.4):
    - MFE-peak round-trip trades: trail catches profit ~+50%
      of peak (instead of round-tripping to 0)
    - Top-200 trades (high MFE): may capture 1-1.5 ATR more
      than current LX_NM_Time exit
    - Overall net: +200K~+500K estimated improvement
    - MDD: should improve (less round-trip damage)
    - Trade count: unchanged (trail doesn't affect entries)

  L5 v19.8 LESSON CHECK:
    L5 SP module failed because Top-10 tail concentration > 70%
    made SP cut winners. S1's tail concentration unknown - need
    to check from v2.4 data. If Top-10 < 70%, Trail B should
    work fine (similar to L5 God Mode trail which DID work).
    Verification done in pre-deployment analysis.

  DEPLOY ONLY WHEN FLAT (changes exit fills for trades with
  MFE between 1.5 ATR and 2.0 ATR that previously survived
  to LX_NM_Time at 09:00).
}

inputs:
    LookbackBars(11),
    ATRLen(11),
    EntryATRMult(0.2),
    RangeMinATR(0.9),
    RangeMaxATR(4.5),
    StopATRMult(2.75),
    TargetATRMult(2.0),

    { v2.5: Trail parameters (TrailActATR lowered from 2.75 to 1.5) }
    TrailActATR(1.5),               { v2.5: MUST be < TargetATRMult or Trail is dead. Was 2.75. }
    TrailOffATR(0.7),               { Trail offset (unchanged) }
    Trail_Mode(2),                  { v2.5 NEW: 0=off (v2.4 behavior), 1=Variant A (fixed lock), 2=Variant B (true ratcheting trail). Default = B (recommended) }

    NightOpen(1500),
    ExitTime(500),                  { v2.4: captures overnight gap via 09:00 fill }
    VolSlowLen(70),
    VolRatioMin(0.80),

    { v2.4 Holiday Safety Module }
    Holiday_Flat_Time(415),
    Registry_Valid_Until(1270101),
    Manual_Kill_Switch(false);

variables:
    v_NightHigh(0),
    v_NightLow(999999),
    v_NightBarCount(0),
    v_RangeReady(false),
    v_IsNightSession(false),
    v_ATR(0),
    v_EntryATR(0),
    v_RangeWidth(0),
    v_Prev_MP(0),
    v_SlowATR(0),
    v_VolRatio(0),
    v_VolPass(false),

    { Holiday Safety state }
    v_Holiday_Block(false),
    v_Registry_Expired(false),
    Registry_Warn_ID(-1),
    hidx(0),

    { v2.5 Trail state }
    v_HighestClose(0),              { tracks max close during position (Variant B) }
    v_TrailArmed(false),            { trail has been armed once threshold hit }
    Trail_Warn_ID(-1);              { dead-config warning text ID }

arrays:
    Holiday_Tail[80](0);

{ ==========================================
  HOLIDAY TAIL REGISTRY (shared with L1/L2/L3/L4/L5)
  ========================================== }

if CurrentBar = 1 then begin
    Holiday_Tail[1]  = 1190913;  Holiday_Tail[2]  = 1191010;
    Holiday_Tail[3]  = 1200101;
    Holiday_Tail[4]  = 1200121;  Holiday_Tail[5]  = 1200228;
    Holiday_Tail[6]  = 1200402;  Holiday_Tail[7]  = 1200501;
    Holiday_Tail[8]  = 1200625;  Holiday_Tail[9]  = 1201001;
    Holiday_Tail[10] = 1201009;  Holiday_Tail[11] = 1210101;
    Holiday_Tail[12] = 1210206;  Holiday_Tail[13] = 1210227;
    Holiday_Tail[14] = 1210402;  Holiday_Tail[15] = 1210612;
    Holiday_Tail[16] = 1210918;  Holiday_Tail[17] = 1211009;
    Holiday_Tail[18] = 1211231;
    Holiday_Tail[19] = 1220127;  Holiday_Tail[20] = 1220226;
    Holiday_Tail[21] = 1220402;  Holiday_Tail[22] = 1220430;
    Holiday_Tail[23] = 1220603;  Holiday_Tail[24] = 1220909;
    Holiday_Tail[25] = 1221008;  Holiday_Tail[26] = 1221231;
    Holiday_Tail[27] = 1230118;  Holiday_Tail[28] = 1230225;
    Holiday_Tail[29] = 1230401;  Holiday_Tail[30] = 1230429;
    Holiday_Tail[31] = 1230622;  Holiday_Tail[32] = 1230929;
    Holiday_Tail[33] = 1231007;  Holiday_Tail[34] = 1231230;
    Holiday_Tail[35] = 1240206;  Holiday_Tail[36] = 1240228;
    Holiday_Tail[37] = 1240404;  Holiday_Tail[38] = 1240501;
    Holiday_Tail[39] = 1240608;  Holiday_Tail[40] = 1240917;
    Holiday_Tail[41] = 1241010;  Holiday_Tail[42] = 1250101;
    Holiday_Tail[43] = 1250123;  Holiday_Tail[44] = 1250228;
    Holiday_Tail[45] = 1250403;  Holiday_Tail[46] = 1250501;
    Holiday_Tail[47] = 1250530;  Holiday_Tail[48] = 1250927;
    Holiday_Tail[49] = 1251004;  Holiday_Tail[50] = 1251010;
    Holiday_Tail[51] = 1251024;  Holiday_Tail[52] = 1251225;
    Holiday_Tail[53] = 1260101;
    Holiday_Tail[54] = 1260212;  Holiday_Tail[55] = 1260227;
    Holiday_Tail[56] = 1260403;  Holiday_Tail[57] = 1260501;
    Holiday_Tail[58] = 1260619;  Holiday_Tail[59] = 1260925;
    Holiday_Tail[60] = 1261009;  Holiday_Tail[61] = 1261024;
    Holiday_Tail[62] = 1261225;  Holiday_Tail[63] = 1270101;
end;

v_Holiday_Block = false;

if Time <= 500 then begin
    for hidx = 1 to 80 begin
        if Date = Holiday_Tail[hidx] then
            v_Holiday_Block = true;
    end;
end;

v_Registry_Expired = false;

if Date > Registry_Valid_Until then begin
    v_Registry_Expired = true;
    v_Holiday_Block    = true;
end;

if LastBarOnChart and
   DateToJulian(Date) >= DateToJulian(Registry_Valid_Until) - 30 then begin
    if Registry_Warn_ID < 0 then begin
        Registry_Warn_ID = Text_New(Date, Time, High + 400,
            "HOLIDAY REGISTRY EXPIRES " +
            NumToStr(Registry_Valid_Until, 0) +
            " - REBUILD FROM TAIFEX CALENDAR");
        Text_SetColor(Registry_Warn_ID, Red);
        Text_SetSize(Registry_Warn_ID, 14);
        Text_SetAttribute(Registry_Warn_ID, 1, true);
    end;
end;

{ v2.5 Dead-Trail-Config WARNING - prevents silent dead code }
if LastBarOnChart and Trail_Mode > 0 and TrailActATR >= TargetATRMult then begin
    if Trail_Warn_ID < 0 then begin
        Trail_Warn_ID = Text_New(Date, Time, High + 600,
            "TRAIL DEAD: TrailActATR=" + NumToStr(TrailActATR, 2) +
            " >= TargetATRMult=" + NumToStr(TargetATRMult, 2) +
            " - TP fires first, Trail never activates!");
        Text_SetColor(Trail_Warn_ID, Red);
        Text_SetSize(Trail_Warn_ID, 16);
        Text_SetAttribute(Trail_Warn_ID, 1, true);
    end;
end;

{ ATR calculation }
v_ATR = AvgTrueRange(ATRLen);

{ Volatility expansion filter }
v_SlowATR = AvgTrueRange(VolSlowLen);
if v_SlowATR > 0 then
    v_VolRatio = v_ATR / v_SlowATR
else
    v_VolRatio = 1;
v_VolPass = (v_VolRatio >= VolRatioMin);

{ Detect night session }
v_IsNightSession = (Time >= NightOpen) or (Time < ExitTime);

{ Reset at night session open }
if Time >= NightOpen and Time[1] < NightOpen then begin
    v_NightHigh = 0;
    v_NightLow = 999999;
    v_NightBarCount = 0;
    v_RangeReady = false;
end;

{ Build opening range from first N bars }
if v_IsNightSession and v_RangeReady = false then begin
    v_NightBarCount = v_NightBarCount + 1;
    if High > v_NightHigh then v_NightHigh = High;
    if Low < v_NightLow then v_NightLow = Low;
    if v_NightBarCount >= LookbackBars then begin
        v_RangeWidth = v_NightHigh - v_NightLow;
        if v_ATR > 0 and
           v_RangeWidth >= v_ATR * RangeMinATR and
           v_RangeWidth <= v_ATR * RangeMaxATR then
            v_RangeReady = true;
    end;
end;

{ Entry: Long breakout (v2.1 logic + Holiday Block guard) }
if v_RangeReady and v_IsNightSession and Time < ExitTime and
   v_VolPass and v_Holiday_Block = false then begin
    if v_Prev_MP <= 0 and v_ATR > 0 then
        buy ("LE_NM_Long") next bar at v_NightHigh + v_ATR * EntryATRMult stop;
end;

{ Freeze ATR at entry time }
if MarketPosition = 1 and v_Prev_MP <= 0 then
    v_EntryATR = v_ATR;

{ v2.5 Track HighestClose during position (for Variant B trail) }
if MarketPosition = 1 then begin
    if v_HighestClose = 0 then
        v_HighestClose = Close;
    if Close > v_HighestClose then
        v_HighestClose = Close;
end;

{ Priority 0: Holiday Safety }
if MarketPosition = 1 then begin
    if Manual_Kill_Switch then
        sell ("LX_NM_Kill") next bar at market
    else if v_Registry_Expired then
        sell ("LX_NM_RegistryEnd") next bar at market
    else if v_Holiday_Block and Time >= Holiday_Flat_Time then
        sell ("LX_NM_Holiday") next bar at market;
end;

{ Exit: ATR-based stop loss (principal protection) }
if MarketPosition = 1 and v_EntryATR > 0 then
    sell ("LX_NM_SL") next bar at EntryPrice - v_EntryATR * StopATRMult stop;

{ Exit: ATR-based take profit }
if MarketPosition = 1 and v_EntryATR > 0 then
    sell ("LX_NM_TP") next bar at EntryPrice + v_EntryATR * TargetATRMult limit;

{ v2.5 Trail (mutually exclusive A/B by Trail_Mode) }
if MarketPosition = 1 and v_EntryATR > 0 and Trail_Mode > 0 then begin

    { Arm trail once profit threshold hit }
    if MaxContractProfit / 200 >= v_EntryATR * TrailActATR then
        v_TrailArmed = true;

    if v_TrailArmed then begin
        if Trail_Mode = 1 then
            { Variant A: fixed lock at Entry + (TrailAct - TrailOff) × ATR }
            sell ("LX_NM_Trail_A") next bar at
                EntryPrice + v_EntryATR * (TrailActATR - TrailOffATR) stop;
        if Trail_Mode = 2 then
            { Variant B: true ratcheting trail at HighestClose - TrailOff × ATR }
            sell ("LX_NM_Trail_B") next bar at
                v_HighestClose - v_EntryATR * TrailOffATR stop;
    end;

end;

{ Exit: Time-based forced close at 09:00 (overnight gap capture) }
if Time >= ExitTime and Time < NightOpen then begin
    if MarketPosition = 1 then
        sell ("LX_NM_Time") next bar at market;
end;

{ v2.5 State reset on flat }
if MarketPosition = 0 then begin
    v_HighestClose = 0;
    v_TrailArmed = false;
end;

{ Track previous bar position }
v_Prev_MP = MarketPosition;
